  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Shaping the Future of Indonesia&#x2019;s Healthcare through the Digital Health Transformation
Strategy (DHTS) 2025-2029</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is aimed at supporting the Ministry of Health in the development of Digital Health Transformation Strategy (2025-2029) and its implementation roadmap. This project will cover two out of four missions including 1) ensuring inclusive, efficient, and use-oriented digitalization of health services; and 2) encouraging innovation and collaboration in the digital health ecosystem. These all will ensure Indonesia to build a sustainable, data-driven, and inclusive digital health ecosystem with a clear strategy and actionable actions to achieve the ambition.</narrative>
  </description>
